{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51433","headline":"广陵 · 赵嘏","name":"广陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"广陵城中饶花光，赚得英雄尽白头。\n（《国史补》曰：「进士科得之艰难，其有老死於文场者，亦无所恨。\n故诗云云。\n」《画墁录》以爲赵嘏作。\n（李肇《国史补》无此则。\n《唐摭言》卷一录此二句，不云作者，《全唐诗》卷七九六收作无名氏句。\n《画墁录》谓赵嘏作，未言所据。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}